"signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-13T08:58:31-07:00","id":1296427,"title":"","content":"<b>Rose Dame, Moonsilver Sword, Artifact \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 </b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.redd.it/e22csa26gjk21.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Evocations</b><b> of Rose Dame</b><br /> <br /> The mirror shards of Rose Dame is exceptional at abosrbing energy and essence-based attacks, granting its master a non-charm Defense when blocking such attacks. Her allies in short range also benefit from this bonus as light and flame and all things that burn can't help but be drawn toward their Dame.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#980000\">Shattering-Roses Beginning</span></b></span></b><br /> <b>Cost</b>: 5m, 3a, 1wp; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1<br /> <b>Type</b>: Reflexive<br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Dissonant, Resonant<br /> <b>Duration</b>: One Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite</b>: None<br /> <br /> The Exalted hangs high Rose Dame into the air as her anima is absorbed into the sword, she then smashes it into the ground, shattering it into pieces. For the rest of the scene, she can attack out to Medium range as she directs the flying shard to attack her enemies, Rose's previous owner uses its hilt like a composer, moving the shattering blade into a symphony of cutting death.<br /> <br /> <b>Dissonant: </b>Rose Dame can only attack enemy out to Short range.<br /> <br /> <b>Resonant: </b>The Exalted can pay 3m to attack enemy out to Long range but lose the benefit from the sword's Defense bonus for this round.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 03-14-2019, 03:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-13T09:07:59-07:00","id":1296429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1296422-elegant-portraits-of-divine-artifact-husbando-actually-sfw-arts-for-artifacts?p=1296425#post1296425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">{the best excited reaction gif I could find seemed sort of inappropriate}</div> </div> </div> </div>It's alright, I can feel the sentiment through text just fine ~<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-13T11:29:36-07:00","id":1296464,"title":"","content":"A collected Jen art thread? Very nice. I love the design and first evocation for the Rose Dame, that's a great start. (And that Theo drawing, hah, truly he is an exalt of many talents.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T05:45:24-07:00","id":1296663,"title":"","content":"<b>Medeia, Starmetal Knife, Artifact \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 </b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.redd.it/b6quwnricu621.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Evocations of Medeia</b><br /> To his friend, the witch is a fountain of knowledge and empowerment, allowing him to Introduce Fact even if he has no relevant specialty or backstory at an increased +2 Difficulty, a character will receive one on-charm dice on their roll if they employ a witch's fact, they must accept a Minor positive Intimacy toward the witch the action is succeed, this rush of positive feeling toward the witch can be resist by paying one Willpower.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#980000\">One Harmless Obedient Witch</span></b></span></b><br /> <b>Cost</b>: 5m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1<br /> <b>Type</b>: Reflexive<br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Dissonant, Resonant<br /> <b>Duration</b>: Indefinite<br /> <b>Prerequisite</b>: None<br /> <br /> To any who would slander the witch's good name, they will find the hero's mind an impassible sanctuary. A character's Resolve is increased by one against any attempts to degrade his Intimacy toward the witch.<br /> <br /> At Essence 3, this Evocation automatically upgraded, allowing the character to store one Witch point whenever they benefit from any Fact introduced by the witch, they can spend these points to increase both their Resolve and the Resolve's dice cap. A character can only have 5 Witch points at any given times.<br /> <br /> <b>Dissonant: </b>Characters dissonant with Starmetal can not access the upgrade at essence 3.<br /> <br /> <b>Resonant: </b>The Resolve added by Witch points are counted as non-charm dice.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#980000\">Letting The Wrong One In</span></b></span></b><br /> <b>Cost</b>: 5m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1<br /> <b>Type</b>: Reflexive<br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Dissonant<br /> <b>Duration</b>: One Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite</b>: None<br /> <br /> A thousand Luna can't even compare to the fickleness of a man's heart, men are wicked beast that can't help but betray those who love them and the witch will be the divine retribution comes crashing down like a torrent of needles. A character who benefited from a Fact introduced by the witch but develops a negative Intimacy toward him instead (whenever in their first meeting or later) are <i>despised. </i>The witch's attacks against such characters received several benefits depend on the strength of their Tie toward him as long as this Evocation is active:<ul><li>Minor: +1 Overwhelming</li> <li>Major: Ignore 5 Soak and 1 Hardness</li> <li>Defining: Wounds inflicted by the witch can not be healed naturally and required specialized magical effects to do so.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <b>Dissonant: </b>Only the first two benefits are available to those who can't resonant with Starmetal and a mote surcharge is required every rounds to keep the Evocation actives.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#980000\">Tamed Witch Kills Savage Wife</span></b></span></b><br /> <b>Cost</b>: -; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 2<br /> <b>Type</b>: Permanent<br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Resonant<br /> <b>Duration</b>: Permanent<br /> <b>Prerequisite</b>: Letting The Wrong One In<br /> <br /> Vile weed always decorate the path to a man's heart , with sickle in hand a witch clears the path to his true love. This evocation expand the definition of <i>despised </i>to include characters that has positive intimacies toward the same character as the witch does.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#980000\">Scarlet Web of Straw Dolls</span></b></span><br /> Cost</b>: -; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 3<br /> <b>Type</b>: Permanent<br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Resonant<br /> <b>Duration</b>: Permanent<br /> <b>Prerequisite</b>: Celestial Circe Sorcery<br /> <br /> Once a character benefit from a Fact introduced by the witch on 5 separate roll, he becomes an effigy, a symbolic link that the witch can use to cast effects that require it such as Silent Words of Dreams and Nightmares (<i>Exalted, p.475</i>). This effect can only be used once per week and will only target characters whom the effigy has a positive intimacy toward and vice versa.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 03-14-2019, 09:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T05:46:58-07:00","id":1296665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>YeOfLittleFaith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1296422-elegant-portraits-of-divine-artifact-husbando-actually-sfw-arts-for-artifacts?p=1296464#post1296464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> (And that Theo drawing, hah, truly he is an exalt of many talents.)</div> </div> </div> </div>The benefit of not having a character sheet is that he's basically has 5 dots in theoretically everything x'D","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"li